cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these tables, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Reliability-aware Fiber-seq readout of young LINE-1 (L1PA2) promoter accessibility in human pluripotent cells"
abstract: >-
  Copy-level Fiber-seq accessibility at L1PA2 5' UTRs, with an explicit measurement-reliability
  framework: split-half and haplotype agreement, a readability rule, attenuation correction for
  the correlation with an external anchor, and a noise-only simulation band.
